v data-contents-type=\"text\">October 13, 2026 at 23:30 PDT / October 14, 2026 at 8h30 CEST</div></td></tr><tr><th data-colwidth=\"230\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">​Duration:</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">4hours</div></td></tr><tr><th data-colwidth=\"230\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Affected Services:</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Game servers</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Details of the update will be shared at a later time.<u><strong>​</strong></u></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><u><strong>Additional Notices:</strong></u></div><ul><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Once maintenance begins, you will be disconnected from the game.</div></li></ul><ul><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">The maintenance schedule and details are subject to change at any time. Any changes will be announced as an update via this notice.</div></li></ul><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">&nbsp;Thank you!</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fcfc554b-8d7f17b3-8210-4b6e-b017-67db8956863b&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/downloa